[00:00.000] 作词 : Shaffer Smith/Tor Erik Hermansen/Mikkel S. Eriksen
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Shaffer Smith/Tor Erik Hermansen/Mikkel S. Eriksen
[00:08.730]Mmmm mmm yeah
[00:10.610]Do do do do do do do-do
[00:15.850]Ohh Yeah
[00:19.660]Gotta change my answering machine (换掉了电话答录机)
[00:22.370]Now that I'm alone (现在我很孤独)
[00:24.840]Cuz right now it says that we (因为刚才它说的是)
[00:27.310]Can't come to the phone (“我们无法接电话”)
[00:29.660]And I know it makes no sense (我知道这毫无意义)
[00:32.290]Cuz you walked out the door (因为你早已离去)
[00:34.910]But it's the only way I hear your voice anymore (但是我再也不用听到你的声音)
[00:40.250](it's ridiculous) (这好荒唐)
[00:41.610]It's been months (几个月来)
[00:44.700]And for some reason I just (有些东西)
[00:45.670](can't get over us) (我老是想不明白)
[00:47.350]And I'm stronger then this (我开始坚强起来)
[00:49.810](enough is enough) (适可而止吧)
[00:52.720]No more walkin round (我不再垂头丧气地)
[00:54.690]With my head down (四处散心)
[00:56.700]I'm so over being blue (也不会为你忧郁)
[00:58.300]Cryin over you (为你哭泣)
[01:00.490]And I'm so sick of love songs (我讨厌这些情歌)
[01:03.100]So tired of tears (也讨厌眼泪)
[01:06.540]So done with wishing you were still here (我受够了孤寂，希望身边有你)
[01:11.070]Said I'm so sick of love songs so sad and slow (我讨厌这些缓慢的、悲伤的情歌)
[01:16.440]So why can't I turn off the radio? (而我为何不把这收音机关掉)
[01:20.810]Gotta fix that calender I have (我撤下了日历上)
[01:23.600]That's marked July 15th (七月十五日的标记)
[01:25.700]Because since there's no more you (因为我们之间)
[01:29.000]There's no more anniversary (再也没有什么纪念日)
[01:30.760]I'm so fed up with my thoughts of you (我已厌倦了想你)
[01:33.700]And your memory (以及回忆我们的过去)
[01:35.770]And how every song reminds me (为何每首歌都在唤醒着我)
[01:37.340]Of what used to be (对过去的记忆)
[01:40.610]That's the reason I'm so sick of love songs (这就是我为什么讨厌这些情歌)
[01:43.189]So tired of tears (也讨厌眼泪)
[01:45.980]So done with wishing you were still here (我受够了孤寂，多希望身边有你)
